      "content": "3\ndevelopment of autonomous, scalable, and trustworthy LMA systems, paving the way for the next\ngeneration of software engineering\nTo summarize, this study makes the following key contributions:\n• We conduct a systematic review of 71 recent primary studies on the application of LMA systems\nin software engineering.\n• We perform two case studies to illustrate the current capabilities and limitations of LMA systems.\n• We identify the key research gaps and propose a structured research agenda that outlines potential\nfuture directions and opportunities to advance LMA systems for software engineerin",
